FEATS=- feat(release): add safety guards and robust version bump script
- feat: add one-click auto-update, minimize to tray, release automation and refine status texts
- feat(build): modernize and unify build scripts, add CI workflow and changelog generator
- feat(update): bake in default GitHub Pages update feed URL (v1.1.2)
- feat: centralize version management in root VERSION file (SSOT)
- feat(site): auto-detect and sync latest release directly via GitHub Releases API
- feat(site): dynamic latest release link synchronization from version.json
- feat: live proxy ping, proxy profile presets, and environment doctor card
- feat(ui): round app icon corners to match system squircle style
- feat: initial release of Open Antigravity v1.0.0
FIXES=- fix(build): enforce single source of truth for version and auto-sync Cargo.toml
- fix(gui): strip verbatim path prefix, add unified vector icons and enhance active switch contrast
- fix(ci): respect linux sandbox loopback race condition in test step
- fix(ci): fix yaml indentation in release changelog step
- fix(platform): restore Path import for non-windows target (v1.1.2)
- fix(gui): lift footer toolbar away from bottom window border (v1.1.2)
- fix: single-instance elevation race, fallback symbol fonts, and proxy switch state (v1.1.2)
- fix(ci): fix yaml indentation in release.yml workflow
- fix: remove Steam integration and minimize portable release files to essentials (v1.1.1)
OTHER=- chore(release): bump version to v1.1.4
- chore(build): refine release version writing in build.cmd
- docs & ci: add permanent latest asset links and document --release workflow
- chore: eliminate all compiler warnings across modules
- chore(release): bump version to v1.1.3
- chore(build): remove legacy build_portable.cmd and package_release.cmd
- chore: align Cargo package version with release version v1.1.2 and automate sync
- chore(release): bump version to v1.1.2
- chore(release): bump version to v1.1.1
- docs: track and update AGENTS.md with SSOT versioning and modern build architecture
- chore: update default version references to v1.1.0 across scripts and templates
- docs: update README.md for v1.1.0 with feature details, proxy profiles, doctor card, and download table
- chore: release v1.1.0 updates for docs website and workflow sync fix

